
Hyperledger Fabric + FabCar
===========================

1. Start the test network
-------------------------
/fabric-install/fabric-samples/fabcar$ ./startFabric.sh 
~/fabric-install/fabric-samples/test-network ~/fabric-install/fabric-samples/fabcar

2. Create a channel
-------------------
./network.sh createChannel
# or for a specific name
./network.sh createChannel -c mychannel

3. Deploy FabCar chaincode
--------------------------
./network.sh deployCC -ccn fabcar -ccp ../fabcar/chaincode-go -ccl go
# or JavaScript version
./network.sh deployCC -ccn fabcar -ccp ../fabcar/chaincode-javascript -ccl javascript

4. Enroll Admin and Register User
---------------------------------
cd ~/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript
node enrollAdmin.js
node registerUser.js

5. Start API Backend Server
---------------------------
cd ~/fabric-install/fabric-samples/fabcar/fabcar-backend$ node server.js


# Expected:
~/fabric-install/fabric-samples/fabcar/fabcar-backend$ node server.js
