6. REST API Commands (using curl or Postman)
--------------------------------------------

Register user:
--------------
curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"gregoryUser"}'

Query all cars:
---------------
curl http://localhost:3001/api/cars

# Query specific car
.........................
curl http://localhost:3001/api/cars/CAR0

# Add new car
...........................
curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/cars \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"carId": "CAR13", "make": "Honda", "model": "Civic", "color": "white", "owner": "Gregory"}'


# Change ownership
............................
curl -X PUT http://localhost:3001/api/cars/CAR13 \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"owner": "Bob"}'


7. Create Frontend (React + Vite)
---------------------------------
npm create vite@latest fabcar-frontend -- --template react
cd fabcar-frontend
npm install
npm run dev

# Vite homepage should show successfully.

